  "summary": "The ~95–100 t articulated wheel loader is the flexible loading unit of the mine: it reclaims the ROM-pad grade bins into the dump hopper for blending, back-up loads trucks when an excavator is down, cleans up spillage and moves quickly between pits on its tyres. A Z-bar linkage gives strong breakout force for digging; the machine steers by articulating about the centre hitch.",
